          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne obulekhuule bwanje bunyala burie okhuchelwa khumwoyo kwoundi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isie nimba nindiakhwo nende okhuupa orio, nishiina eshichila ninjiishilwa shieneshio eshia ekhupiilekhwo orio? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho kata nimulia, kata nimunywa, kata liosi liosi elia mukhola, kholenje kosi nimuchooma okhuusia oluyali lwaNyasaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Murareetsangakhwo eshiisichirasio shiosi, kata khubaYahudi, kata khubaYunani, kata khukanisa yaNyasaye tawe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shinga isie siesi olwa enjamisinjia abandu bosi mumakhuwa kosi, nindakhaaba okhwinyoolela omwene ebieinganga ta, habula inganga yobunji bwabandu, mbu bahonibwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.33",
